<section image-layout="blank" id="slf79en9Qj"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="_-YedioLbd"><p role="eyebrow">Illustrative options · same field task</p><h2>Select the system, not the biggest machine</h2><p>Across the same 12 m swath, the schematic compares pass count. The wider system raises capacity and lowers cost only if it fits the tractor, field and work standard.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="UAE08YXnQd" cell-style="subtle" padding="14pt 18pt" colspan="30"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item vertical-align="center" colspan="30"><h3>2.0 m system</h3></grid-item><grid-item vertical-align="center" align="end" colspan="30"><labels><label variant="outline">OPTION A</label></labels></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="tO1OUQ8uDD" background-color="palette-3" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="10"></grid-item><grid-item id="2n1ODfGiCz" background-color="palette-3" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="10"></grid-item><grid-item id="RkB0_iJGRy" background-color="palette-3" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="10"></grid-item><grid-item id="R9aH37beoM" background-color="palette-3" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="10"></grid-item><grid-item id="eGVFSFP9jn" background-color="palette-3" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="10"></grid-item><grid-item id="mMDcZBZOY-" background-color="palette-3" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="10"></grid-item></grid><p font-size="13pt">Six 2.0 m passes across the schematic swath.</p><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="36"><p font-size="13pt"><b>Capacity</b><br/><math>2.0\times5.0\times0.70\div10=0.70\text{ ha/hour}</math></p><p font-size="13pt"><b>Cost rate</b><br/><math>\$54/\text{hour}\div0.70=\$77.14/\text{ha}</math></p></grid-item><grid-item vertical-align="center" colspan="24"><display font-size="36pt">$77.14<span font-size="16pt">/ha</span></display></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="Zb-c5zav0K" cell-style="subtle" padding="14pt 18pt" colspan="30"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item vertical-align="center" colspan="30"><h3>3.0 m system</h3></grid-item><grid-item vertical-align="center" align="end" colspan="30"><labels><label variant="solid">OPTION B · CONDITIONAL</label></labels></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="y7WN0iSXoP" background-color="accent" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="15"></grid-item><grid-item id="5PJ2YLLrhR" background-color="accent" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="15"></grid-item><grid-item id="0GIsHu_tAW" background-color="accent" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="15"></grid-item><grid-item id="K4hyPzl-ES" background-color="accent" padding="0" style="min-height:18pt" colspan="15"></grid-item></grid><p font-size="13pt">Four 3.0 m passes across the schematic swath.</p><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="36"><p font-size="13pt"><b>Capacity</b><br/><math>3.0\times6.0\times0.75\div10=1.35\text{ ha/hour}</math></p><p font-size="13pt"><b>Cost rate</b><br/><math>\$78/\text{hour}\div1.35=\$57.78/\text{ha}</math></p></grid-item><grid-item vertical-align="center" colspan="24"><display font-size="36pt">$57.78<span font-size="16pt">/ha</span></display></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="P4IPH4o9gM" background-color="accent" padding="12pt 16pt"><p><b>Decision gate:</b> verify power and hitch · soil load and work quality · transport width and access · annual utilization.</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="12pt"><span text-color="muted">Pass diagram is schematic, not a plan of the full 12 ha field. Operating speed must remain compatible with soil and work-quality requirements.</span></p></grid-item></grid></section>